   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Election Observ. 07 TAF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Election Observ. 07 TAF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is that &apos;Bangladesh&apos;s 2007 Parliamentary election is judged broadly free, fair and safe by national and international bodies and improves levels of political representation and accountability&apos;. The project purpose is that &apos;the risk of an election that is violent, and judged not free and not fair, is reduced&apos;. The Embassy contribution to the project is SEK 1,500,000.</narrative>
